        "original_id": "ad66ac4c-72fe-5847-aa0b-13da9030a28b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Boy Hits Car, The Invisible\n- Albums: All That Led Us Here, The Invisible, My Animal\n- Events: European tour, Mercury Prize\n\nFacts:\n- In 1998, Boy Hits Car released My Animal as their debut album.\n- On 9 March 2009, The Invisible released their self-titled debut album The Invisible.\n- In 2009, The Invisible's debut album The Invisible was nominated for the Mercury Prize and was selected as iTunes critics' choice for album of the year.\n- In May 2014, Boy Hits Car released All That Led Us Here as their fifth studio album.\n- After releasing All That Led Us Here in May 2014, Boy Hits Car followed it with a European tour.",
